---
// Bottom CTA banner with Material Symbols
---

<section class="offscreen-defer py-12 md:py-18 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0B57D0] via-[#0842A0] to-[#041E49] text-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-[#0B57D0]/20">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center relative z-10">

    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-3 font-heading text-white">
      Ready for a Smooth &amp; Reliable Journey?
    </h2>

    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm md:text-base text-white/90 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-normal leading-relaxed mb-8 font-sans">
      Reserve early with <strong class="text-white font-semibold">₹0 advance</strong> — pay only after your trip completes safely. Sanitized AC cabs, police-verified chauffeurs, and transparent flat &amp; per-km pricing.
    </p>

    <div class="flex justify-center">
      <a
        href="#booking-panel"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 px-9 py-3.5 rounded-m3-full bg-white hover:bg-[#F0F4F9] active:bg-[#E8F0FE] !text-[#0B57D0] hover:!text-[#0842A0] text-m3-label-l font-bold shadow-m3-2 hover:shadow-m3-3 transition-all cursor-pointer transform hover:-translate-y-0.5 active:translate-y-0 border border-white/40 group"
      >
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px] text-[#0B57D0]">calculate</span>
        <span>Calculate Your Fare</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-[#0B57D0] transform group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">arrow_forward</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
